WHAT THIS COMPONENT IS

The RetentionOps Connector is the data-plane half of RetentionOps. It runs inside a
customer's own network, holds their database credentials, and is the only component
that ever connects to their databases. It is open source so that the people who have to
approve installing it can read exactly what it can and cannot do.

The RetentionOps control plane — planner, policy engine, scheduler, approvals, tenancy,
identity, entitlements, billing, evidence service and web console — is a separate,
proprietary product of Solutions Optigm inc. It is not part of this repository, is not
covered by this licence, and is not required in order to read, build, audit, modify or
run this connector.

